<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange finished higher in heavy trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 78.12 to 6703.79, a record. For the week, the Dow rose 159.70 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 2.18 to 400.76, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.23.</p>
<p>Losers edged out winners 1258 to 1235.</p>
<p>Volume was 545,749,090 compared with 554,116,390 Thursday.</p>
